                <mxCell id="br_note" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;font-size:10px;line-height:1.5&quot;&gt;&#10;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;Business Rules &amp;amp; Compliance&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#10;&lt;b&gt;BR1&lt;/b&gt; — 2D Double-Booking Prevention: Therapist + Treatment Room must both be available&lt;br&gt;&#10;&lt;b&gt;BR2&lt;/b&gt; — Consolidated Billing: No checkout with pending unpaid Spa/F&amp;amp;B orders&lt;br&gt;&#10;&lt;b&gt;BR3&lt;/b&gt; — Data Minimization (RBAC):&lt;br&gt;&#10;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;• Therapist → physical treatment health data only&lt;br&gt;&#10;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;• Chef → food allergy data only&lt;br&gt;&#10;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;• Receptionist → neither health nor allergy data&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#10;&lt;b&gt;Legal:&lt;/b&gt; Vietnam Decree 356/2025 (Explicit consent, Encrypted health data, Right to Deletion)&lt;br&gt;&#10;&lt;b&gt;Legal:&lt;/b&gt; Law on Residence 2020 (Guest ID encrypted at rest, Daily police report)&#10;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=18;fillColor=#fce4ec;strokeColor=#c62828;strokeWidth=1;shadow=1;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=8;spacingBottom=8;verticalAlign=top;" parent="1" vertex="1">
